sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student
    participant Monaco as Monaco Editor Component
    participant API as Axios Problem Client
    participant Router as Express Problem Router
    participant Service as Code Execution Service
    participant Sandbox as AST Local Sandbox / Judge0
    participant DB as MongoDB Submissions

    Student->>Monaco: Types code solution in editor
    Student->>Monaco: Clicks "Submit Solution"
    Monaco->>API: POST /api/problems/:slug/submit {code, language}
    API->>Router: Protected HTTP Request (JWT Bearer)
    Router->>Service: submitSolution(problemId, code, language, user)
    Service->>Service: AST Lexical Token Filter (Block require/process)
    
    alt AST Security Violation Detected
        Service-->>Router: Throw Security Error ("Forbidden token detected")
        Router-->>API: 400 Bad Request
        API-->>Monaco: Display Security Violation Alert
    else AST Security Check Passed
        Service->>Sandbox: executeAgainstTestCases(code, testCases)
        loop Each Test Case (Sample & Hidden)
            Sandbox->>Sandbox: Execute in Null-Prototype VM / Python Process
            Sandbox->>Sandbox: Compare Normalized Output with Expected
        end
        Sandbox-->>Service: Return {status: "Accepted", time: 42ms, passed: 5/5}
        Service->>DB: create(Submission Record)
        Service->>DB: Update Problem (totalSubmissions, solvedCount)
        Service->>DB: Update User (streak, problemsSolved)
        Service-->>Router: Return Grading Results
        Router-->>API: 200 OK {success: true, results}
        API-->>Monaco: Render Confetti & Results Drawer
    end